      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "6",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ogosirigwa kw’Abaisraeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obobe nobwabo abwo bamenyete buya agwo Sayoni, na abwo batoererete ase ebitunwa bia Samaria, abwo bare abasike b’egesaku egetang’ani, eki Abaisraeli bagochiera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Genda goika Kaline, moyorore, naende mogende goika Hamati, oyio ore omochie omonene, naende motirimboke gochia Gati bw’Abafilisti. Inee! Barabwo nigo bare buya kobua abanto b’amarwoti aya are aiga? Gose chingongo chiabo nechinene kobua orogongo rwaino?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obobe nobwaino, inwe abamogoteeba ng’a rituko ri’obobe ng’are rire, na mwanchera ogokora okobe kw’obotindi kobeera ase egati yaino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obobe nobwaino inwe aba mokoraarera amarere achabeire amaino e chinchogu, naende mwaba mokwerambora ase ebirogo biaino bigwotota. Nigo mokoba mokoria chimanwa chi’eching’ondi chichorire, ne chimori chinoru korwa ase ameeri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inwe nigo mogotera amatera ay’okwoga, na mweroiseria amakano ao ao, aya mokobugia, buna Daudi akorete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nigo mokonywa edivai korwa ase ebitaabo ebinene, naende mweaka amaguta e rigori rinene, korende timoichanereti ogosirigwa kw’ororeria rwa Yusufu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio, inwe mobe ab’eritang’ani koirwa ase obosomba, na emegoko y’emeyega yaino neere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.6.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene, Nyasae bw’Emeganda, nigo agoteeba iga: “Inche Omonene netianirie ngoteeba: Nigo ngechirie noboenenu bw’ abanto ba Yakobo, na nigo ngechete chinyomba chiabo chinkong’u. Ase ayio nintige omochie osirigwe amo n’ebinto bionsi bireo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.6.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebe ng’a onye abasacha ikomi batigaire ase enyomba eyemo, nabarabwo goika bakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omoamate bw’omonto oyio okuure nache kobogoria amauga amo noyo ogochia koyasamba. Omoamate oria narangerie onde bwensi otigarete ase enyomba eria ime, amoborie, “Onde nare aa motigarete komo?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.6.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omonto oria nairanerie, akane, “Yaya.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.6.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Erio omoamate oria namoteebie “Kira‐kiri! Twerende titobaisa gwatora erieta ri’Omonene.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.6.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio rora, Omonene narue ogochika ng’a chinyomba chire chinene na echire chinke chiiyerigwe inse chisamunyokane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inee! Chibarasi nchinyare kominyoka igoro ase egetare? Gose omonto nanyare korema egetare ne chiombe? Korende inwe mwaonchoire ayare ay’oboronge abeire obosongo, na okwama kw’oboronge kwabeire obororo buna chinkama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.6.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inwe nigo mokogokera egento kere bosa, mogoteeba, “Inee! Titwenyorerete ching’unchara goetera ase chinguru chiaito abanyene?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.6.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aya naro Omonene, Nyasae bw’Emeganda, agoteeba: “Inwe Abaisraeli rora, nimbarentere abanto b’egesaku gete; barabwo mbaabachande gochakera ase egesoero kia Hamati goikera ase akarooche g’Ekerubo Ekiomo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.6.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
